| GPyTorch | ✓                  | ✗                     | ✗                         | ✗                   | ✗             | ✗                  | ✗              |
| GPflow   | ✓                  | ✗                     | ✗                         | ✗                   | ✗             | ✗                  | ✗              |
| BoTorch  | ✓                  | ✓                     | ✗                         | ✗                   | ✗             | ✗                  | ✗              |
| DeepChem | ✗                  | ✗                     | ✓                         | ✓                   | ✗             | ✗                  | ✗              |
| GraKel   | ✗                  | ✗                     | ✗                         | ✗                   | ✓             | ✗                  | ✗              |
| FlowMO   | ✓                  | ✗                     | ✓                         | ✓                   | ✗             | ✓                  | ✓              |
